title: drac1
---
<<set $ghostname = "Ghost 1">>
<<sprite "ghost">>
<<theme "drac">>
Say hello:
-> funny
    <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    You: Bone-jour!
-> neutral
    You: Hi.
-> serious
    <<set $drac = $drac - 1>>
    You: Hello, it is nice to meet you.
-> flirty
    <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    You: Hello, boo-tiful!
{$ghostname}: Hello.
Ask:
-> about horses
    You: Got any thoughts about horses?
    <<set $drac = $drac - 1>>
    => {$ghostname}: Scary.
    => {$ghostname}: *neighs*
    => {$ghostname}: Too many teeth.
    => {$ghostname}: *shudders* Too many.
    => {$ghostname}: Never.
    => {$ghostname}: My parents were murdered by a horse.
-> about anime
    <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    You: Who is your favourite "My Favourite Anime" character?
    => {$ghostname}: Obviously Anichi-chan.
    => {$ghostname}: Probably Shin Oyama.
    => {$ghostname}: Fluffy, the murder goose.
    => {$ghostname}: Definitely Dr Evelle Batt Gui.
    => {$ghostname}: Never seen it.
    => {$ghostname}: Uuuh, Hannelore, I guess?
-> about communism
    <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    You: Do you ever catch yourself thinking about the spectre that's haunting Europe?
    => {$ghostname}: Far too often.
    => {$ghostname}: We have nothing to lose but our chains.
    => {$ghostname}: I am deadly afraid of ghosts.
    => {$ghostname}: I even know that bitch.
    => {$ghostname}: *starts humming the Internationale*
    => {$ghostname}: Never.
You: Thank you for your honesty.
===
